      At the end of 2009, the population of Tianjin Municipality was 12.28&nbsp;million, of which 9.8&nbsp;million owned and lived in Tianjin ''[[Hukou system|hukou]]'' (permanent residences). Among permanent residents of Tianjin, 5.99&nbsp;million lived in urban ar
      The encompassing [[metropolitan area]] was estimated by the [[OECD]] (Organization for Economic Cooperation and Development) to have, {{As of|2010|lc=y}}, a population of 15.4 million.
      The majority of Tianjin residents are [[Han Chinese]]. People from 51 out of the 55 minor Chinese ethnic groups live in Tianjin. [[List of ethnic groups in China|Minorities]] with higher populations in the city include [[Hui people|Hui]], [[Koreans|Korean]], [
