      {{Historical populations
      |title       = Historical population
      |footnote    = Established in 1923; dissolved in 1932 and incorporated into [[Manchukuo]] / Heilongjiang Province (present).<br />Harbin part of Heilongjiang Province until 1947–1949 and 1953–1954.<br />Dongsheng SAR dissolved in 1932 and incorporated into Man
      |1912 |2,029,000
      |1928 |3,725,000
