      In 2023, the [[Central Committee of the Chinese Communist Party]] and the [[State Council of China]] jointly proposed making Fujian a [[Fujian Demonstration Zone|demonstration zone]] in [[Cross-strait relations|cross-strait]] integration between Taiwan and mai
