      Many ethnic Chinese around the world (especially in [[Southeast Asia]]) trace their ancestries to the Fujianese branches of the [[Hoklo people|Hoklo]] and [[Teochew people|Teochew]] peoples. Descendants of [[Southern Min]]-speaking emigrants make up the majori
