      In 1996, Shandong became the first province in China to achieve full electrification of all households. In 1999, [[Zhanhua County]], the province's last officially designated impoverished county, was declared poverty-free. In 2004, Shandong overtook [[Guangdon
      [[File:青岛港大港.jpg|thumb|Benefited from its coast, Shandong experienced rapid economic growth after 1978. Ports like [[Qingdao Port|Qingdao]], [[Yantai Port|Yantai]], and [[Rizhao port|Rizhao]] are constantly ranked top 50 in the world [[List of busiest containe
