      In 2011, the development plan for the [[Shandong Peninsula|Shandong Peninsula Blue Economic Zone]] was officially approved. On 3 June 2014, the [[State Council of the People's Republic of China|State Council]] formally approved the establishment of the nationa
      In August 2019, the State Council approved the establishment of the China (Shandong) Pilot Free Trade Zone, which includes three areas: Jinan, Qingdao, and Yantai. By 2020, the total population of the [[Shandong Peninsula|Shandong Peninsula urban agglomeration
